    "fe500593d54c52e2120299806f9c9770ed8fa88f2ea9ef41cd612f9cf93e3c44": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "0abf8b9069e0f1f4df1d2954df1836ba598a01bf72437c3f3f296ad3523197f9",
      "contextFingerprint": "377db5ea50315e58bf425d026c4d5701a1fe9a7cdbf5281d6be7035f02073c16",
      "sourceText": "*这个时候我们就需要积分来起作用了。我们知道曲线的积分相当于曲线与x轴围出来的面积。如下图，积分作用的目的是使红色部分的面积和蓝色部分的面积的和为0，那么即使系统在比例控制和微分控制部分已经趋于稳定，只要Err不为0就会存在静差，只要存在静差那么积分就会对系统产生影响，直到系统的Err值为0。那么这样我们的PID控制在理论上就可以达到一个非常精确的控制效果。*",
      "translatedText": "*At this point, we need the integral to come into play\\. We know that the integral of a curve is equivalent to the area enclosed by the curve and the x\\-axis\\. As shown in the figure below, the purpose of the integral action is to make the sum of the area of the red part and the area of the blue part equal to 0\\. Thus, even if the system has already become stable in the proportional control and derivative control parts, as long as Err is not 0, a steady\\-state error will exist\\. As long as a steady\\-state error exists, the integral will affect the system until the Err value of the system becomes 0\\. In this way, our PID control can theoretically achieve a very precise control effect\\.*",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 219,
        "outputTokens": 155,
        "costUsd": 0.000252
      }
    },
